## Pre-ship checklist (mandatory before completing any task)
- [ ] Read all user-visible copy; no developer jargon or placeholder text
- [ ] Confirm GA tracking (G-JKEBQ0M6NQ) is present on any new or modified HTML page
- [ ] Confirm the shared footer mount (#es-footer) is present on any new HTML page
- [ ] Remove console.log and debug statements
- [ ] Check both themes, even when the change is not theme related
- [ ] New components reference semantic tokens only, never --n-* colour primitives
- [ ] Check the keyboard path, including the mobile filter drawer
- [ ] Run ./scripts/ship-check.sh and confirm PASS
- [ ] Provide a status report listing every file modified and any concerns

See CLAUDE.md for the specific bugs that have already regressed once
(tooltip stickiness, drawer focus trap, inert sidebar, aria labels).
